# Build and GitHub Pages

Node runs the dev server and the production compile.

- `npm run dev` — Vite on port **8080**
- `npm run build` — `tsc --noEmit`, then Vite into `dist/`
- `base` in `vite.config.ts` stays `./` so Pages can serve the compiled site
- Do not commit `dist/`. `.github/workflows/pages.yml` compiles and publishes it on every push to `main` or `master`
- Pages source is GitHub Actions, not a hand-copied folder

Do not add test runners, test files, or extra GitHub workflows. The Pages workflow is the only automation.
